      "title": "New minor risk - Financial data availability",
      "body": "The company's latest financial reports are more than 6 months old. Last reported fiscal period ended March 2025. This is considered a minor risk. If the company has not reported its earnings on time, it may have been delayed due to audit problems or it may be finding it difficult to reconcile its accounts. Currently, the following risks have been identified for the company: Major Risks Shares are highly illiquid. High level of non-cash earnings (85% accrual ratio). Minor Risks Latest financial reports are more than 6 months old (reported March 2025 fiscal period end). Market cap is less than US$100m (₹2.24b market cap, or US$24.1m).",
